<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Welcome to Virtual Piano!</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: #f4f4f4; }
        h1 { text-align: center; }
        .slide { display: none; padding: 20px; }
        .active { display: block; }
        button { margin: 10px; padding: 10px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <h1>Welcome to Virtual Piano!</h1>
    <div id="slideshow">
        <div class="slide active">
            <h2>Slide 1: Introduction to VirtualPiano.net</h2>
            <p>VirtualPiano.net is an online piano simulator that allows you to play piano using your keyboard or mouse.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="slide">
            <h2>Slide 2: Getting Started</h2>
            <p>Visit <a href="https://virtualpiano.net" target="_blank">VirtualPiano.net</a> to access the piano.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="slide">
            <h2>Slide 3: Using Your Keyboard</h2>
            <p>Use the keys on your keyboard to play notes. The keys correspond to the piano keys.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="slide">
            <h2>Slide 4: Playing Songs</h2>
            <p>Explore the song library to find popular songs to play along with.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="slide">
            <h2>Slide 5: Tips for Practice</h2>
            <p>Practice regularly and try to play along with the songs to improve your skills!</p>
        </div>
        <div class="slide">
            <h2>Final Slide: Enjoy Playing!</h2>
            <p>Have fun and enjoy making music with VirtualPiano.net!</p>
        </div>
    </div>
    <button onclick="prevSlide()">Previous</button>
    <button onclick="nextSlide()">Next</button>

    <script>
        let currentSlide = 0;
        const slides = document.querySelectorAll('.slide');

        function showSlide(index) {
            slides.forEach((slide, i) => {
                slide.classList.toggle('active', i === index);
            });
        }

        function nextSlide() {
            currentSlide = (currentSlide + 1) % slides.length;
            showSlide(currentSlide);
        }

        function prevSlide() {
            currentSlide = (currentSlide - 1 + slides.length) % slides.length;
            showSlide(currentSlide);
        }
    </script>

</body>
</html>
